1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,860
If your friend never knocks,

2
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:02,825
check the mirror.

3
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:04,927
Remember their first visit?

4
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:06,720
They waited outside,

5
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,519
even though the door was open.

6
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:09,671
You laughed.

7
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:10,950
Just come in.

8
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:12,214
You don't have to ask.

9
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,417
They never asked again.

10
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:15,925
Last night,

11
00:00:15,925 --> 00:00:18,315
you woke with their hand around your wrist.

12
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,046
You said I could come in.

13
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,519
You reached for the lamp.

14
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,052
They held on.

15
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:26,970
In the mirror,

16
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,858
your arm was hanging in mid-air.

17
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:30,744
Alone.

18
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:34,240
Then their fingers tightened.
